WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.750
In the first twenty verses of Chapter 14,

2
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:38.291
Lord Krishna described the influence and results

3
00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:40.166
of the three gunas –

4
00:00:40.166 --> 00:00:42.125
sattva, rajas, and tamas.

5
00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:43.541
Now from verse 14.21,

6
00:00:43.541 --> 00:00:46.250
the discussion of the gunatita state begins –

7
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.625
the state of rising

8
00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:50.875
above the gunas.

9
00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:51.750
Here Arjun

10
00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:54.041
asks three important questions,

11
00:00:54.041 --> 00:00:55.708
which Lord Krishna will answer

12
00:00:55.708 --> 00:00:57.625
in the verses ahead.

13
00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:04.375
Until now, Lord Krishna has explained

14
00:01:04.375 --> 00:01:06.291
that sattva, rajas, and tamas –

15
00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:08.500
all three gunas influence our actions,

16
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.250
our future,

17
00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:12.833
and even our death.

18
00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:16.416
Now Arjun asks three questions

19
00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:18.416
with deep curiosity.

20
00:01:18.416 --> 00:01:22.541
The first – kaih lingaih:

21
00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:24.000
what are the inner signs

22
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.875
by which we can recognise that a
seeker has risen

23
00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:29.666
above the gunas?

24
00:01:29.666 --> 00:01:33.166
The second – kim acharah:

25
00:01:33.166 --> 00:01:34.833
what is such a person’s outer conduct?

26
00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:38.916
How does their daily behaviour appear?

27
00:01:38.916 --> 00:01:41.291
The third – katham etan

28
00:01:41.291 --> 00:01:44.416
trin gunan ativartate:

29
00:01:44.416 --> 00:01:45.791
and how can a seeker themselves

30
00:01:45.791 --> 00:01:49.583
cross beyond all three gunas?

31
00:01:49.583 --> 00:01:50.291
This question

32
00:01:50.291 --> 00:01:52.416
is similar to the one asked in Chapter 2

33
00:01:52.416 --> 00:01:54.708
about the sthitaprajna – the person
of steady wisdom.

34
00:01:54.708 --> 00:01:55.958
But here Arjun

35
00:01:55.958 --> 00:01:58.875
wishes to understand even more deeply.

36
00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:00.375
He wants not only the signs,

37
00:02:00.375 --> 00:02:04.208
but also the method of practice.

38
00:02:04.208 --> 00:02:06.333
In the verses that follow, Lord Krishna

39
00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:08.208
answers all three questions

40
00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:09.833
in detail.

41
00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:18.083
Many times in life you can see

42
00:02:18.083 --> 00:02:20.708
what is pulling you back –

43
00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:24.333
sometimes the restlessness of the mind,
sometimes anger,

44
00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:29.625
sometimes fear, or the relentlessly
running ambition.

45
00:02:29.625 --> 00:02:34.625
You may even know the reason.

46
00:02:34.625 --> 00:02:38.000
But I ask you –

47
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:43.208
is merely knowing the problem enough?

48
00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:47.375
Or do you also wish to go beyond it?

49
00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:50.708
Do not stop only at recognition.

50
00:02:50.708 --> 00:02:55.500
Like Arjun, ask the next question –

51
00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:58.666
‘How do I move forward from here?’

52
00:02:58.666 --> 00:03:01.833
This is the mark of a true seeker –

53
00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:05.000
one who wants not only answers,

54
00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:08.083
but transformation too.

55
00:03:08.083 --> 00:03:09.375
Some people

56
00:03:09.375 --> 00:03:12.916
always delay – applications, paying fees,

57
00:03:12.916 --> 00:03:14.708
or a child’s school payments –

58
00:03:14.708 --> 00:03:17.750
right until the last date.

59
00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:21.500
Sometimes they miss the deadline
and pay a late fee,

60
00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:25.000
or even lose a precious opportunity.

61
00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:28.541
They know this habit of theirs,

62
00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:33.333
yet repeat it every time.

63
00:03:33.333 --> 00:03:36.125
Only firm resolve

64
00:03:36.125 --> 00:03:39.000
can take them beyond it.

65
00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.416
Perhaps you too have seen this in yourself –

66
00:03:41.416 --> 00:03:44.625
getting stuck again and again

67
00:03:44.625 --> 00:03:46.250
in old habits.

68
00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.875
Finding that emotions

69
00:03:47.875 --> 00:03:52.250
override your resolve.

70
00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:55.375
Good – you have understood the influence

71
00:03:55.375 --> 00:03:59.000
of these habits and feelings.

72
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.291
But now, like Arjun,

73
00:04:02.291 --> 00:04:08.125
turn your heart toward the deeper question –

74
00:04:08.125 --> 00:04:12.250
‘How do I cross beyond this?’

75
00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:17.458
Do not settle for self-awareness alone.

76
00:04:17.458 --> 00:04:21.958
Aspire for self-liberation.

77
00:04:21.958 --> 00:04:25.125
Because real peace does not come only

78
00:04:25.125 --> 00:04:28.416
from understanding your limitations.

79
00:04:28.416 --> 00:04:34.041
It comes when you cross beyond them.

80
00:04:34.041 --> 00:04:38.583
And I am with you to help you move forward

81
00:04:38.583 --> 00:04:40.458
in this.

82
00:04:45.291 --> 00:04:47.375
In families, conversations often

83
00:04:47.375 --> 00:04:52.250
remain limited to the daily routine –

84
00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:54.000
‘Have you eaten?’

85
00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.000
‘Where are you going?’

86
00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.583
‘Why hasn’t this been done yet?’

87
00:04:58.583 --> 00:05:02.500
If you want a deeper connection,

88
00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:05.833
begin asking deeper questions.

89
00:05:05.833 --> 00:05:09.000
Like Arjun, take curiosity

90
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.166
to a higher level.

91
00:05:11.166 --> 00:05:14.375
Do not only ask ‘what happened?’ –

92
00:05:14.375 --> 00:05:16.750
ask ‘what are you experiencing?’

93
00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:20.000
Do not only ask ‘why did you do this?’ –

94
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:24.500
ask ‘what do you need right now?’

95
00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.875
These are the questions

96
00:05:25.875 --> 00:05:27.625
that open the heart

97
00:05:27.625 --> 00:05:30.041
and become the foundation of trust.

98
00:05:30.041 --> 00:05:32.666
Understand this deeply –

99
00:05:32.666 --> 00:05:34.708
when a family member

100
00:05:34.708 --> 00:05:36.250
feels safe sharing

101
00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:40.000
their inner world,

102
00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.500
they naturally begin to grow.

103
00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:45.000
They reflect.

104
00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:46.916
They experience

105
00:05:46.916 --> 00:05:50.208
that their words have been valued.

106
00:05:50.208 --> 00:05:54.000
Your questions become a mirror for them –

107
00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:57.791
in which they can look within.

108
00:05:57.791 --> 00:06:03.958
So do not speak to each other
only as a formality.

109
00:06:03.958 --> 00:06:07.208
Speak to each other’s soul.

110
00:06:07.208 --> 00:06:08.958
When curiosity

111
00:06:08.958 --> 00:06:13.250
is nourished by love and knowledge, the family

112
00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.541
does not only live together –

113
00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:19.000
it grows together.

114
00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:25.000
And then the home becomes a
place of true progress.

115
00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.041
Reflect on this.

116
00:06:30.916 --> 00:06:32.958
Progress at the workplace

117
00:06:32.958 --> 00:06:33.916
does not only come

118
00:06:33.916 --> 00:06:38.458
from setting targets or completing lists –

119
00:06:38.458 --> 00:06:41.791
it comes from asking the right questions.

120
00:06:41.791 --> 00:06:46.166
Arjun did the same with Lord Krishna –

121
00:06:46.166 --> 00:06:49.083
he did not only ask about the problem,

122
00:06:49.083 --> 00:06:53.333
but also asked how to go beyond it.

123
00:06:53.333 --> 00:06:57.291
This is where true leadership begins.

124
00:06:57.291 --> 00:06:59.416
When you begin asking such questions

125
00:06:59.416 --> 00:07:02.583
at your workplace –

126
00:07:02.583 --> 00:07:06.333
‘What is truly stopping our growth?’

127
00:07:06.333 --> 00:07:08.875
‘Are we working with clarity

128
00:07:08.875 --> 00:07:11.291
or only under pressure?’

129
00:07:11.291 --> 00:07:13.708
‘What impact is my conduct

130
00:07:13.708 --> 00:07:15.625
having on my team?’ –

131
00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:19.125
you stop being only a manager of tasks

132
00:07:19.125 --> 00:07:22.291
and become a catalyst for change.

133
00:07:22.291 --> 00:07:26.166
These questions are not asked for control –

134
00:07:26.166 --> 00:07:28.833
they are asked to bring awareness.

135
00:07:28.833 --> 00:07:33.708
They lift you and your team above the surface.

136
00:07:33.708 --> 00:07:37.458
And from here, better decisions are born.

137
00:07:37.458 --> 00:07:38.208
For example –

138
00:07:38.208 --> 00:07:40.291
suppose the demand for a company’s product

139
00:07:40.291 --> 00:07:42.166
suddenly falls.

140
00:07:42.166 --> 00:07:46.000
Simply recognising that sales have dropped

141
00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:49.208
in some area is not enough.

142
00:07:49.208 --> 00:07:53.500
It is also necessary to look at the reasons –

143
00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:56.625
is it a drop in quality, low-cost

144
00:07:56.625 --> 00:07:58.000
options from competitors,

145
00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:02.250
or the sales team’s indifferent behaviour?

146
00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:03.875
When these causes

147
00:08:03.875 --> 00:08:06.166
are examined with patience,

148
00:08:06.166 --> 00:08:08.708
not only does the problem become clear,

149
00:08:08.708 --> 00:08:11.666
but the solution also emerges.

150
00:08:11.666 --> 00:08:15.958
So before rushing toward a solution,

151
00:08:15.958 --> 00:08:18.958
pause for a moment and reflect.

152
00:08:18.958 --> 00:08:24.291
Ask – ‘What are we not seeing?

153
00:08:24.291 --> 00:08:27.875
What can we cross beyond?’

154
00:08:27.875 --> 00:08:28.708
The right questions

155
00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:32.875
are not just the start of a conversation –

156
00:08:32.875 --> 00:08:35.458
they are like a compass

157
00:08:35.458 --> 00:08:38.375
that shows the direction of growth.

158
00:08:38.375 --> 00:08:43.250
And from here, true leadership is born.

159
00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.375
Reflect on this.
